<section class="text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end">
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <p class="tag text-primary">Getting here</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2.5rem,4.6vw,4.25rem)] leading-[1.02] text-balance">A blue door on Calle del <em>Telar</em></h2>
      </div>
      <address class="not-italic md:col-span-5 md:col-start-8">
        <span class="display block text-3xl">Calle del Telar 14</span>
        <span class="mt-1 block text-base-content/80">Barrio de Jalatlaco, 68080 Oaxaca de Juárez, Mexico</span>
        <span class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Calle+del+Telar+14+Jalatlaco+Oaxaca" class="btn btn-primary">Open in Maps</a>
          <a href="tel:+529515550142" class="btn btn-outline">Call the house</a>
        </span>
      </address>
    </div>
    <figure class="mt-12 aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-box sm:aspect-[21/9]" data-settle data-sun>
      <img src="/media/street.jpg" class="size-full object-cover">
    </figure>
    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-300 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <li class="bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl">From the airport</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base-content/80">Twenty-five minutes by the airport's official taxi, or by our own pickup: tell us your flight when you ask for your dates.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl">From the bus station</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base-content/80">The first-class station is ten minutes on foot, downhill past the Jalatlaco church. We can meet you there.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl">By car</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base-content/80">The street is narrow and cobbled. There is a guarded lot on Calle Hidalgo, two blocks away, at about $8 a night.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-base-100 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-2xl">On foot</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base-content/80">Twelve minutes to Santo Domingo, eighteen to the zócalo, along streets that are quiet after dark.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
